<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Northeast Utilities raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Northeast Utilities raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it upgraded Northeast Utilities to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- &quot;At a 50 percent discount to the group, Northeast Utilities is undervalued,&quot; UBS said.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/2 to 12-1/2 in late morning exchange trading.</p>
</text>
